Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.91,0:00:03.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tahun ketiga
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.21,0:00:04.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}di SMA.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.12,0:00:06.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semua orang menghabiskan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.25,0:00:07.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tahun terakhir mereka
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tanpa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.09,0:00:09.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}ada penyesalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.01,0:00:12.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Musim berikutnya
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.59,0:00:15.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tiba dalam sekejap mata.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.23,0:00:39.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}"You and I Are Polar Opposites\NSeason 2"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.02,0:01:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kii!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.94,0:01:49.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di mana tas yang isinya frisbee sama raket?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.02,0:01:50.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mau dipakai, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.94,0:01:52.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mau pergi ke taman besar hari ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.19,0:01:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bawa itu pasti bakal lebih seru.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.07,0:01:55.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi katanya,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.69,0:01:56.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}hari ini mau hujan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.70,0:01:57.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masa, sih?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.95,0:01:59.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Beneran.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.11,0:02:02.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal kami mau main ultimate frisbee\Nbareng anak klub tenis hari ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:04.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi batal dan diganti\Njadi main futsal indoor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.54,0:02:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Main tenis saja sana!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.54,0:02:08.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi cuacanya lagi bagus begini.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.03,0:02:11.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuh, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.84,0:02:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harus bagaimana, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.17,0:02:16.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa hari ini dibatalkan saja?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.34,0:02:19.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal sudah lama kita enggak berduaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.22,0:02:23.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku enggak masalah mau ke mana pun,\Ntapi aku ingin ganti lokasinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.48,0:02:28.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Natsumi, kamu mau main ke rumahku hari ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.36,0:02:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, kita jadi basah kuyup begini.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.53,0:02:41.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.95,0:02:44.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu enggak penting.\NAku cuma ingin bertemu denganmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.83,0:02:46.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Habisnya,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.58,0:02:49.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kapan pun ada kesempatan untuk bertemu,\Naku pasti sangat ingin bertemu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.38,0:02:52.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.30,0:02:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ikut tim pemandu sorak pasti berat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.09,0:02:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku benar-benar kelelahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.23,0:03:12.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lihat ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.57,0:03:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa ada orang di rumahmu hari ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.91,0:03:24.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya itu pertanyaan yang aneh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.53,0:03:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan sepertinya lagi,\Nitu memang pertanyaan aneh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.20,0:03:30.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Astaga, bagaimana ini?\NMemalukan sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.41,0:03:31.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Habisnya…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.62,0:03:34.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku kelupaan beli buah tangan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.25,0:03:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, begitu rupanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.05,0:03:40.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat datang, Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.42,0:03:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, ini Natsumi yang asli!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.09,0:03:44.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rambutmu sudah panjang, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.26,0:03:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.18,0:03:47.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu bukan pertanyaan\Nuntuk orang yang baru pertama ketemu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.93,0:03:49.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu sudah makan siang?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.68,0:03:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah, aku sudah makan sebelum ke mari.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.44,0:03:54.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, biar kuambilkan\Nmanju susu yang aku sembunyikan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.94,0:03:56.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.27,0:03:57.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memangnya kamu sembunyikan di mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.28,0:04:01.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo, lihat ke sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.53,0:04:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo kita kirimkan fotonya ke Kasumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.78,0:04:07.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu kakakmu?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.91,0:04:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.70,0:04:13.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau suamiku ada di sini,\Ndia pasti juga akan sangat senang.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.92,0:04:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo kita kirimkan aura positif ini padanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.25,0:04:20.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayahnya Kentaro…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.08,0:04:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia sedang dinas ke luar kota.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.68,0:04:26.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mau main murder mystery\Nbareng teman-teman klubku.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.55,0:04:28.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu bahkan sudah bukan olahraga lagi namanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.35,0:04:31.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Duluan, ya, Natsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.35,0:04:32.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik, hati-hati di jalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.81,0:04:34.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ken, kalian mau mengobrol di kamarmu?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.60,0:04:36.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Manjunya bagaimana?\NEnggak jadi dimakan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.19,0:04:37.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biar kubawa saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.19,0:04:40.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong,\Nkamarmu sudah siap menerima tamu?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.82,0:04:42.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah aku bereskan, kok.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.44,0:04:44.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Natsumi, mau minum apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.66,0:04:45.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.86,0:04:48.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa saja boleh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.95,0:04:51.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo masuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.75,0:04:58.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Asyik banget kamarmu ada sofanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.00,0:05:00.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu sebenarnya ranjang sofa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.42,0:05:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah lama\Naku menjadikannya sofa seperti itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.26,0:05:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, kamu kecapekan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.59,0:05:07.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku hanya merasa…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.89,0:05:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sedikit kaget.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.64,0:05:13.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sifatmu saat di rumah sama persis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.02,0:05:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.48,0:05:18.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh, bukan… Maksudku, kamu benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.27,0:05:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku merasa ekspresinya waktu di rumah
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.28,0:05:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}enggak ada bedanya dengan saat dia\Nsedang bersama anak-anak di sekolah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.03,0:05:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Natsumi, mau pergi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.11,0:05:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apaan? Rapi banget bajumu?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.66,0:05:30.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tumben dandan rapi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.87,0:05:32.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memangnya mau ketemuan sama siapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.62,0:05:34.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cuma mau kumpul bareng teman-teman SMA…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.42,0:05:39.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak sepertiku, yang selalu memilih\Nuntuk merahasiakan semuanya
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:43.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}biar enggak dijauhi atau diledek.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.76,0:05:48.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu selalu menunjukkan jati dirimu,\Ntak peduli dengan siapa pun kamu bersama.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.51,0:05:52.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh, tunggu dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.60,0:05:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat bersamamu,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.77,0:05:57.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sebenarnya aku berusaha sekuat tenaga\Nsupaya kelihatan keren, lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.11,0:06:02.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, apanya yang lucu?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.82,0:06:09.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah mencetak foto-foto\Nsaat festival olahraga.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.62,0:06:11.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benarkah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.87,0:06:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Keren banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.74,0:06:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tim pemandu soraknya kelihatan keren banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.04,0:06:17.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harusnya kamu ikut bergabung dengan kami.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.62,0:06:19.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak ah, aku lebih suka menonton\Naksi kalian tiap tahunnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.00,0:06:22.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bakal canggung kalau aku\Njadi salah satu anggotanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.59,0:06:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, begitu rupanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.63,0:06:28.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini foto Kawasaki pas lagi baca\Nsumpah atlet, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.09,0:06:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kapten kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.76,0:06:33.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini Gapacho,\Nyang enggak sengaja ikut terfoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.26,0:06:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.81,0:06:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini foto-fotonya Tim Merah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada lumayan banyak\Nfoto Sato dan Azuma di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.60,0:06:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong kasihkan ke mereka kalau sempat, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.19,0:06:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Azuma kelihatan lucu banget di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.24,0:06:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu, bukannya foto Tim Hijau
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.99,0:06:49.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}terlalu sedikit?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.57,0:06:53.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Habisnya aku ingin\Nmelihatnya secara langsung.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.87,0:06:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, begitu rupanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.76,0:07:10.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mendekatlah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.85,0:07:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu enggak suka, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.02,0:07:19.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu dulu?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.94,0:07:22.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus bagaimana? Rasanya…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.11,0:07:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Natsumi, apa aku boleh menciummu?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.28,0:07:27.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku deg-degan banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.74,0:07:30.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jantungku berdegup kencang.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.03,0:07:31.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aliran darah
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.95,0:07:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}di sekujur tubuhku terasa aneh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.32,0:07:36.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pinggangku? Tulang punggungku?\NRasanya sangat menggelitik.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.33,0:07:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ciuman?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.54,0:07:47.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan ditanya lama-lama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.17,0:07:50.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masih belum saatnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.47,0:07:52.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rasanya aku bisa mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.26,0:07:53.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.06,0:08:07.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kapan-kapan mampir lagi, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.78,0:08:12.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anginnya kencang sekali!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.82,0:08:15.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berdirilah di sini sebentar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.16,0:08:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.29,0:08:21.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seandainya saja
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.79,0:08:24.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku bisa mengutarakan\Nseluruh perasaanku ini sepenuhnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.54,0:08:28.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sangat ingin dia memahami perasaanku,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.34,0:08:30.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi aku terlalu malu\Nuntuk mengatakan yang sesungguhnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.17,0:08:32.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pikiranku penuh dengan kontradiksi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.47,0:08:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal aku sangat menyukaimu…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.54,0:08:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, kamu bilang apa tadi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.50,0:09:07.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal biasanya aku selalu memedulikan\Npendapat orang lain tentangku.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.38,0:09:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku selalu memendam perasaanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.05,0:09:12.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi saat lagi bareng Kentaro,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.67,0:09:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku jadi sangat egois dan serakah,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.59,0:09:18.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sampai-sampai aku sendiri terkejut.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.69,0:09:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Belajar tiga jam pelajaran berturut-turut\Nbenar-benar melelahkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.90,0:09:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo kita makan yang manis-manis\Nsebelum pulang.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.57,0:09:39.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak ada…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.53,0:09:40.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}warna!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.03,0:09:42.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Warna?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.29,0:09:45.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kehidupan sehari-hari sudah beralih\Nke mode belajar ujian masuk dengan serius.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.37,0:09:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Atmosfernya sangat jauh berbeda\Ndengan saat ujian masuk SMA.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.83,0:09:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah pasti.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.50,0:09:53.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kapan ya terakhir kali\Naku kumpul bareng Tani?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.92,0:09:55.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukannya sudah cukup\Nkalian saling bertemu di sekolah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.01,0:09:58.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar juga, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.26,0:09:59.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi tetap saja aku merasa makin kesepian
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.01,0:10:02.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}setiap kali kami enggak bisa bertemu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.31,0:10:05.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukannya beda karena kamu merasa kesepian,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.18,0:10:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi lebih karena kamu sekarang\Nterlalu fokus pada ujian.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.44,0:10:09.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan mendebatku pakai logika begitu, dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.31,0:10:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tani bilang dia mau masuk\Njurusan pendidikan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.48,0:10:15.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, begitu. Sama sepertiku, dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.15,0:10:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berarti tujuan dia masuk universitas\Nsudah sangat jelas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.49,0:10:22.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kelihatannya dia sudah bercita-cita\Nmenjadi guru sejak lama.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.62,0:10:24.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bahkan pas kita disuruh mengisi survei karier\Ndi tahun pertama masuk SMA,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.83,0:10:28.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dia sudah mantap dengan pilihannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.71,0:10:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mau bagaimana lagi,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.21,0:10:32.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}setiap orang punya tujuannya masing-masing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.29,0:10:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku iri banget sama yang kayak gitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.84,0:10:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Daripada asal dapat pekerjaan\Ntanpa tujuan yang jelas,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.42,0:10:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bisa menggapai impian\Nyang sudah diidamkan sejak kecil
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.93,0:10:42.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}itu rasanya seperti cerita di film-film.\NBukankah itu terdengar keren banget?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.43,0:10:44.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu ini menarik banget, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.02,0:10:47.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan begitu, aku serius, lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.10,0:10:49.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana menjelaskannya, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.10,0:10:51.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kelihatan banget kalau kamu lagi gelisah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.56,0:10:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makanya, jangan dipendam sendiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.48,0:10:53.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Temui saja dia kalau kamu mau.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.86,0:10:54.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu energimu sudah pulih,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.78,0:10:57.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kamu bisa langsung lanjut fokus belajar lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.28,0:10:58.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku paham.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.91,0:11:02.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kadang bawaannya malas belajar
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.62,0:11:03.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}begitu sampai di rumah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.53,0:11:04.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mulai lagi, deh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.99,0:11:07.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal awalnya cuma niat istirahat sebentar,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.37,0:11:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi ujung-ujungnya malah keterusan\Nbuka media sosial.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.33,0:11:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Atau kepikiran cari info harga kos-kosan\Ndi dekat kampus yang belum tentu kumasuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.46,0:11:15.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Atau aku malah iseng mencari\Ntahu lingkungan kampus
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.55,0:11:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}di universitas yang bahkan enggak kuminati.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.51,0:11:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku paham perasaannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.05,0:11:21.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.55,0:11:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu juga pernah begitu, Tani?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.22,0:11:25.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak, aku enggak pernah begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.89,0:11:26.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serius?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.02,0:11:29.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kok bisa kamu sangat disiplin seperti itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.64,0:11:33.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku hanya melakukan\Napa yang memang jadi kewajibanku saat itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.61,0:11:35.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu kan bagian susahnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.11,0:11:37.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuh, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.03,0:11:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia datang.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.24,0:11:42.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menatap…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.16,0:11:45.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu ada jadwal les hari ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.33,0:11:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu,\Nkita harus pisah arah sebentar lagi, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.71,0:11:53.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yu sayang…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.04,0:11:55.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sayang?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.21,0:11:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orang-orang sering bilang musim panas\Nadalah penentu sukses tidaknya
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.63,0:11:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}ujian masuk universitas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.71,0:12:03.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tahu sekarang ini masa-masa sibuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.26,0:12:06.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau dengar kata "musim panas",\Napa yang pertama kali terlintas di pikiranmu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.94,0:12:15.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah banyak orang yang datang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.02,0:12:17.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau dibandingkan dengan tahun lalu,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.50,0:12:19.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}suasananya sangat berbeda, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.86,0:12:26.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memangnya enggak susah\Nberjalan memakai yukata?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.58,0:12:28.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sangat gampang, kok.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.45,0:12:29.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mumpung ada kesempatan,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.95,0:12:33.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku bakal bersenang-senang hari ini\Nsebagai bekal melewati musim panas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.12,0:12:37.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong, gimana hasil ujian uji cobamu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.46,0:12:41.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lumayan bagus dari perkiraanku, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.88,0:12:43.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi aku belum boleh lengah dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.88,0:12:45.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, syukurlah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.59,0:12:49.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga dijadwalkan ikut ujian uji coba\Ndi awal liburan musim panas nanti.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.10,0:12:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku agak takut menghadapi kenyataannya nanti.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.48,0:12:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi mengetahui sebatas apa\Nkemampuanmu itu sangat penting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.10,0:12:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu benar juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.36,0:12:57.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus tahu di mana posisiku sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.86,0:13:00.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu mulai berjuang\Nselangkah demi selangkah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.65,0:13:02.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan berusaha sebaik mungkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.04,0:13:12.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu bilang sempat bingung\Nmau menulis apa untuk pilihan universitasmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.87,0:13:14.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang sudah kamu putuskan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.33,0:13:19.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah memutuskannya\Napa yang mau kutulis untuk saat ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.96,0:13:23.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku belum punya impian
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.67,0:13:26.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}atau target yang jelas seperti yang lainnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.68,0:13:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi karena kondisiku seperti itu,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.18,0:13:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku memutuskan masuk universitas saja untuk\Nmemperbanyak pilihan karierku di masa depan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.90,0:13:39.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kira-kira alasanku itu masuk akal?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.77,0:13:43.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menurutku, orang sepertimu,\Nyang punya impian jelas,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.61,0:13:46.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}benar-benar selalu selangkah lebih maju.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.03,0:13:48.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan bilang begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.16,0:13:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Entah kamu punya tujuan jelas atau enggak,\Nmasuk universitas itu bukan akhir segalanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.70,0:13:56.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kurasa kamu enggak perlu\Nmemutuskan segalanya dari sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.37,0:14:00.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitukah? Semoga saja begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.71,0:14:02.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.92,0:14:06.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Impian, ya…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.63,0:14:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kembang apinya sudah dimulai!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.14,0:14:13.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu semua cuma karena ayahku seorang guru,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.89,0:14:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jadi secara enggak sadar\Naku banyak terpengaruh darinya
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.10,0:14:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sedari aku kecil.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.39,0:14:19.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sadar-sadar,\Naku sudah bercita-cita jadi guru.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.35,0:14:21.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga merasa kalau pilihan itu\Nmemang tepat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.15,0:14:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan berarti aku menentukan jalan ini\Natas kemauanku sendiri,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.65,0:14:27.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi memang cuma jalan ini yang aku tahu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.24,0:14:29.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, indahnya!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.21,0:14:37.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dalam kurun setahun terakhir ini saja,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.50,0:14:41.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku selalu disadarkan
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.08,0:14:44.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kalau masih banyak hal yang belum pernah\Nkucoba dan pemandangan yang ingin kulihat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.22,0:14:50.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya duniaku belum cukup luas
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.26,0:14:52.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}untuk bisa menemukan jalan\Nyang benar-benar kuinginkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.93,0:14:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.48,0:14:58.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untuk apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.48,0:15:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku jadi mulai ragu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.65,0:15:07.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kayaknya aku bakal daftar universitas\Nlewat jalur rekomendasi sekolah, deh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.40,0:15:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Universitas apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.41,0:15:11.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Universitas Eisho.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.12,0:15:14.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jauh sekali lokasinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.79,0:15:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong, Taira, memangnya nilaimu\Nmencukupi buat masuk jalur rekomendasi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.25,0:15:21.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nilai pelajaran hafalanku lumayan bagus,\Njadi masih cukup untuk batas amannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.25,0:15:22.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hebat juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.96,0:15:25.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untuk matematika, tinggal dikerjakan saja\Nsesudah paham konsepnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.92,0:15:27.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, sejujurnya lumayan gampang, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.55,0:15:28.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuh, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.67,0:15:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anak sains pasti selalu ngomong begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.55,0:15:34.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukannya kamu bilang pilihan utamamu\Nitu universitas negeri?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.06,0:15:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, sih,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.06,0:15:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi kalau aku beruntung\Nbisa dapat beasiswa,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.52,0:15:39.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}biayanya bakal jadi lebih murah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.06,0:15:41.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dan…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.56,0:15:44.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jujur saja, aku cuma ingin segera\Nterbebas dari siksaan belajar ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.90,0:15:49.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.49,0:15:53.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebisa mungkin aku tak ingin terus-terusan\Nmenadahkan tangan kepada keluargaku,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.16,0:15:54.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sekaligus ingin bisa merantau.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.49,0:15:57.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu rupanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.50,0:15:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.75,0:16:04.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku berencana mengabarimu soal jadwal buka\Nruang belajar di perpustakaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.54,0:16:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kurasa orang yang masuk jalur rekomendasi\Nenggak akan membutuhkannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.63,0:16:08.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terdengar seperti lagi menyindir, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.05,0:16:14.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Zuma, kamu lagi cari seseorang?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.64,0:16:16.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kok kamu nanya begitu?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.68,0:16:19.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Habisnya dari tadi kamu lihat ke arah pintu terus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.52,0:16:21.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kukira kamu sedang mencari cowok inceranmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.39,0:16:22.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cowok inceran?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.31,0:16:23.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang kelihatannya seperti itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.23,0:16:24.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak mungkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.44,0:16:25.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.52,0:16:28.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Waktu kelas satu dan dua dulu,\Nada kakak kelas yang kami taksir berat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.82,0:16:32.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dulu kami sampai rajin ke kantin tiap hari\Ncuma demi melihat dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.20,0:16:36.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami enggak pernah mengalami\Nmasa-masa kayak gitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.78,0:16:38.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.08,0:16:40.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu beneran mau ambil jalur itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.91,0:16:42.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukannya kamu mengincar\Nmasuk universitas negeri?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.83,0:16:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu beneran mau mendaftar\Ndi Universitas Eisho?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.25,0:16:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya mereka juga punya\Nfakultas pendidikan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.75,0:16:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kampusnya jauh banget, lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.71,0:16:52.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan berarti aku enggak bisa\Npindah ke sana, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.97,0:16:56.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masuk lewat jalur rekomendasi\Nitu lumayan merepotkan, lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.26,0:16:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena ujianmu sudah selesai duluan,\Nbisa-bisa kamu malah dijauhi teman-teman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.26,0:17:00.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terus kalau kamu berbuat\Nulah setelah diterima,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.81,0:17:02.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}masalahnya bakal diusut\Nsampai ke pihak SMA kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.35,0:17:04.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, kamu harus menjaga tingkah lakumu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.90,0:17:06.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bakal repot banget, tuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.40,0:17:07.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.52,0:17:09.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu juga mau daftar jalur itu, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.65,0:17:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.56,0:17:15.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, kamu enggak bakal berubah pikiran?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.20,0:17:21.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gurunya datang agak telat, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.25,0:17:22.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.86,0:17:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Haruskah aku membuka percakapan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.21,0:17:31.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan ah, kalau aku sengaja basa-basi\Nsekarang malah kelihatan aneh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.26,0:17:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu mendaftar lewat jalur\Nrekomendasi sekolah, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.42,0:17:35.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.88,0:17:37.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya tadi aku lihat kamu…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.56,0:17:41.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}…lagi ngobrol bareng Tani.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.22,0:17:43.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu tadi menginterogasinya, ya,\Nkayak bilang begini,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.85,0:17:45.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}"Jalur rekomendasi sekolah itu berdosa."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.48,0:17:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku enggak mengucapkannya dengan sedramatis\Ndan selugas itu, kok.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.94,0:17:52.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku menyadarinya soalnya\Nkita mengincar kampus yang sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.65,0:17:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu, kamu juga\Nmengincar Universitas Eisho?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.32,0:17:57.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar begitu?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.78,0:17:59.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, kita ini saingan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.16,0:18:00.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.03,0:18:02.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau Tani jadi goyah karena ucapanmu tadi,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.00,0:18:04.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kamu enggak bakal bisa\Nmenanggung akibatnya, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.75,0:18:07.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tindakanmu tadi benar-benar buruk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.21,0:18:11.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tadi cuma bercanda, kok.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.21,0:18:14.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagian, dia bukan tipe cowok\Nyang gampang goyah pendiriannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.38,0:18:16.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu ada benarnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.51,0:18:17.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.43,0:18:19.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.89,0:18:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mesin fotokopinya sempat ngadat,\Njadinya aku telat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.52,0:18:26.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Waktu tunggunya terasa lebih lama\Ndari yang kukira.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.14,0:18:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.98,0:18:30.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong, Honda,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.15,0:18:33.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kamu gesit banget mengajukan diri\Njadi seksi kerohanian kelas.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.36,0:18:34.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa itu demi jalur rekomendasi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.24,0:18:37.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebenarnya aku cuma…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.20,0:18:40.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}ingin merasakan memakai ban lengan
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.37,0:18:41.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}di seragamku sekali saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.49,0:18:44.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jujur saja, aku sangat mendambakan\Nmenjadi seksi keamanan kelas,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.00,0:18:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi sayangnya sekolah kita\Nenggak ada seksi seperti itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.91,0:18:49.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia kelihatan sangat aneh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.13,0:18:51.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana denganmu?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.50,0:18:54.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sesi penentuan pengurus kelas seolah
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.15,0:18:56.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}enggak akan selesai kalau enggak ada\Nyang mengacungkan tangan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.47,0:18:58.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kepribadianmu itu malah menyusahkanmu, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.39,0:19:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin mencoba mencicipi\Nseluruh menu yang ada!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.14,0:19:04.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada yang mau temani aku ke sana?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.85,0:19:06.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu! Ayo kita tuntaskan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.52,0:19:08.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku senang kamu mendukung antusiasmeku.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.64,0:19:10.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serahkan saja padaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.23,0:19:16.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, besok kita mau jajan apa…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.24,0:19:18.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.66,0:19:25.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tani.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.29,0:19:28.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukannya kamu mau mengumpulkan ini hari ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.62,0:19:30.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soal itu…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.00,0:19:32.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku memutuskan batal mengumpulkannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:36.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa kata-kataku waktu itu terus\Nterngiang-ngiang di pikiranmu…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.13,0:19:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan, enggak apa-apa, kok.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.21,0:19:38.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, ini enggak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.93,0:19:41.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagian, ini memang pilihanku sendiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.10,0:19:45.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, begitu rupanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.15,0:19:58.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah dikumpulkan formulirnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.28,0:20:01.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa pun nanti hasilnya,\Njangan sampai menyimpan dendam, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.78,0:20:02.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.16,0:20:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tiba-tiba aku mengubah keputusanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.83,0:20:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sini. Kalau mau mengumpulkannya,\Nlakukan dari sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.42,0:20:12.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik, Pak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.46,0:20:18.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ponselku mana, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.71,0:20:20.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, aku duluan balik ke kelas, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.17,0:20:21.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Perlu kutunggu?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.63,0:20:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak usah. Lagi pula,\Narah tujuan kita berbeda.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.22,0:20:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, begitu. Sampai ketemu besok.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.47,0:20:27.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.03,0:20:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukankah dia cewek yang tadi jam makan siang…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.24,0:20:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.16,0:20:48.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wanginya harum sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.99,0:20:51.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku memang sudah menyerahkan formulirnya,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.25,0:20:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi fakta kalau aku belum tahu\Nnasib pemilihan kampusku ini
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.71,0:20:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sangat menyiksaku jika harus\Nterus-terusan menantinya seperti ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.54,0:20:57.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi seandainya aku\Nberhasil lolos di tahap ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.46,0:20:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}masa depanku sudah hampir\Ndipastikan terjamin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.92,0:20:59.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.84,0:21:00.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kalau lolos pun
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.76,0:21:01.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}masih ada saja yang harus dicemaskan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.22,0:21:06.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak ada gunanya juga membanding-bandingkannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.31,0:21:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cewek itu kelihatan manis banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.73,0:21:15.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tiba-tiba saja,\Naku jadi merasa iri pada orang lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.02,0:21:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Suasana hatiku jadi sangat gampang berubah\Nhanya karena hal-hal sepele.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.90,0:21:21.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rasanya seolah…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.32,0:21:24.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.03,0:21:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mana mungkin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.70,0:21:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mana mungkin begitu!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.66,0:21:31.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah pasti bukan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.50,0:21:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang benar saja!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.58,0:21:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aduh, maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.50,0:21:42.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, ternyata kamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.26,0:21:48.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.93,0:21:49.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan menunjukkan ekspresi lega
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.06,0:21:51.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}habis menabrak seseorang, dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.14,0:21:52.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.56,0:21:54.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tadi lagi banyak pikiran.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.77,0:21:56.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu sebentar, tadi aku mikirin apa, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.90,0:21:58.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pikiranku mendadak nge-blank.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.61,0:22:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kemudian,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.78,0:22:06.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Honda berhasil lolos jalur rekomendasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.78,0:22:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang kedengarannya agak aneh bilang begini\Nsesaat setelah menyerahkan formulir pendaftaran,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.78,0:22:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi ada kemungkinan aku bakal ditolak.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.74,0:22:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong kabari aku pas jadwal\Nruang belajarnya buka, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.91,0:22:16.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu benar-benar enggak bisa diandalkan, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.29,0:22:20.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hari-hari yang dipenuhi\Ndengan belajar pun terus berlanjut.
